                <dateline>[<date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content"
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1919-09-10">September 10, 1919</date>]</dateline>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">General Act Revising the General Act of Berlin of
                        February 26, 1885, and the General Act and Declaration of Brussels of July
                        2, 1890</hi></p>
                <p>[For the text of this convention as signed September 10, 1919, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1928v01/pg_437"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1928, volume I, page 437</ref>.]</p>
